    "description": "Now unlocated, Subzupara was a place included on the Antonine Itinerary. The compilers of the Barrington Atlas note that it was located between Arzus and Burdipta.",
    "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: between Arzus and Burdipta. </p>\r\n<p>Parthey and Pinder identify the location with \"Hirmenly\", od. Harmanli (Bulgaria).  </p>",
